{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Mintlify",
    "description": "Qwen-Image 3.0 Pro 的 OpenAI 兼容图片生成与参考图编辑接口。",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "图片生成"
    },
    {
      "name": "图片生成/GPT Image"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/images/generations": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "图片生成",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "网关要求显式传入 `model`。不同模型只支持下表中的参数组合。\n\n| 模型 | 尺寸 | 质量 | 模型专属参数 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `gpt-image-2.5-sunburst` / `flare`（含快照） | 任意 `WIDTHxHEIGHT`（16 倍数、1:3～3:1、最高 3840x2160） | `auto/low/medium/high/xhigh/max` | `background`、`moderation`、`output_format`、`output_compression`、`stream`、`partial_images` |\n| `gpt-image-2`（含快照） | 同上 | `auto/low/medium/high` | 同上；透明背景仍为预览能力 |\n| `gpt-image-1` / `1.5` / `1-mini` | `auto`、1024×1024、1536×1024、1024×1536 | `auto/low/medium/high` | `background`、`moderation`、`output_format`、`output_compression`、`stream`、`partial_images` |\n| `dall-e-3` | 1024×1024、1792×1024、1024×1792 | `standard/hd` | `n` 只能为 1；支持 `style`、`response_format` |\n| `dall-e-2` | 256×256、512×512、1024×1024 | `standard` | 支持 `n=1..10`、`response_format` |",
        "tags": [
          "图片生成/GPT Image"
        ],
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "model",
                  "prompt"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "prompt": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 32000,
                    "description": "必填。要生成图像的文本描述；GPT Image 模型最长 32000 字符，dall-e-2 最长 1000 字符，dall-e-3 最长 4000 字符。"
                  },
                  "background": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "transparent",
                      "opaque",
                      "auto",
                      null
                    ],
                    "description": "背景设置，仅 GPT Image 模型支持。transparent 使用时 output_format 必须为 png 或 webp。"
                  },
                  "model": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "gpt-image-2.5-sunburst",
                      "gpt-image-2.5-sunburst-2026-09-08",
                      "gpt-image-2.5-flare",
                      "gpt-image-2.5-flare-2026-09-08",
                      "gpt-image-2",
                      "gpt-image-2-2026-04-21",
                      "gpt-image-1.5",
                      "gpt-image-1",
                      "gpt-image-1-mini",
                      "dall-e-2",
                      "dall-e-3"
                    ],
                    "description": "必填。图片生成模型。网关不会采用 OpenAI 的 dall-e-2 默认值，必须显式传 model。"
                  },
                  "moderation": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "low",
                      "auto",
                      null
                    ],
                    "description": "内容审核级别，仅 GPT Image 模型支持。auto 为默认值。"
                  },
                  "n": {
                    "type": [
                      "integer",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "minimum": 1,
                    "maximum": 10,
                    "description": "生成的图像数量。dall-e-3 仅支持 1。"
                  },
                  "output_compression": {
                    "type": [
                      "integer",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 100,
                    "description": "图像压缩率（0–100），仅 GPT Image 的 webp 或 jpeg 输出支持，默认 100。"
                  },
                  "output_format": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "png",
                      "jpeg",
                      "webp",
                      null
                    ],
                    "description": "输出图像格式，仅 GPT Image 模型支持。"
                  },
                  "partial_images": {
                    "type": [
                      "integer",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 3,
                    "description": "流式响应中返回的中间图像数量，仅 GPT Image 模型支持。"
                  },
                  "quality": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "auto",
                      "low",
                      "medium",
                      "high",
                      "xhigh",
                      "max",
                      "standard",
                      "hd",
                      null
                    ],
                    "description": "图像质量。GPT Image 支持 auto/low/medium/high；GPT Image 2.5 额外支持 xhigh/max；dall-e-3 支持 standard/hd；dall-e-2 仅支持 standard。"
                  },
                  "response_format": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "仅 dall-e-2 和 dall-e-3 支持 url 或 b64_json。GPT Image 模型始终返回 Base64，不支持此上游参数。",
                    "default": "b64_json",
                    "enum": [
                      "b64_json",
                      "url"
                    ]
                  },
                  "size": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "auto",
                      "256x256",
                      "512x512",
                      "1024x1024",
                      "1536x1024",
                      "1024x1536",
                      "1792x1024",
                      "1024x1792",
                      null
                    ],
                    "description": "图像尺寸。GPT Image 2/2.5 支持 WIDTHxHEIGHT：宽高均为 16 的倍数、比例 1:3～3:1，最高 3840x2160；其他 GPT Image 使用 auto、1024x1024、1536x1024 或 1024x1536；dall-e-2 支持 256x256、512x512、1024x1024；dall-e-3 支持 1024x1024、1792x1024、1024x1792。"
                  },
                  "stream": {
                    "type": [
                      "boolean",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "description": "是否采用 SSE 流式生成，仅 GPT Image 模型支持，默认 false。"
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "vivid",
                      "natural",
                      null
                    ],
                    "description": "生成风格，仅 dall-e-3 支持。"
                  },
                  "user": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "终端用户的唯一标识，用于滥用监控与检测。"
                  }
                },
                "examples": [
                  {
                    "model": "gpt-image-1.5",
                    "prompt": "一只可爱的海獭宝宝，水彩插画风格",
                    "n": 1,
                    "size": "1024x1024",
                    "output_format": "png",
                    "quality": "medium"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "默认": {
                  "value": {
                    "model": "gpt-image-2",
                    "prompt": "Generate a photorealistic red apple resting on a rustic wooden table, soft window light, shallow depth of field.",
                    "size": "1024x1024",
                    "quality": "high",
                    "output_format": "png"
                  },
                  "summary": "默认"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "created",
                    "data"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "created": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "description": "图像创建时的 Unix 时间戳（秒）。"
                    },
                    "background": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "transparent",
                        "opaque"
                      ],
                      "description": "实际采用的背景设置。"
                    },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "description": "生成结果列表。",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "b64_json": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "Base64 编码的图像数据。GPT Image 默认返回；DALL·E 在 response_format=b64_json 时返回。"
                          },
                          "revised_prompt": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "DALL·E 3 实际使用的修订提示词。"
                          },
                          "url": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "format": "uri",
                            "description": "生成图像 URL。仅 DALL·E 且 response_format=url 时返回；有效期为 60 分钟。"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "output_format": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "png",
                        "webp",
                        "jpeg"
                      ],
                      "description": "实际输出图像格式。"
                    },
                    "quality": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "low",
                        "medium",
                        "high"
                      ],
                      "description": "实际生成质量。"
                    },
                    "size": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "实际生成的图像尺寸。"
                    },
                    "usage": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "description": "GPT Image 模型的 token 用量。",
                      "properties": {
                        "input_tokens": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "输入（文本和图像）的 token 数。"
                        },
                        "input_tokens_details": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "image_tokens": {
                              "type": "integer",
                              "description": "输入图像 token 数。"
                            },
                            "text_tokens": {
                              "type": "integer",
                              "description": "输入文本 token 数。"
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "output_tokens": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "输出 token 数。"
                        },
                        "output_tokens_details": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "image_tokens": {
                              "type": "integer",
                              "description": "输出图像 token 数。"
                            },
                            "text_tokens": {
                              "type": "integer",
                              "description": "输出文本 token 数。"
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "total_tokens": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "输入和输出 token 总数。"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "examples": [
                    {
                      "created": 1713833628,
                      "data": [
                        {
                          "b64_json": "..."
                        }
                      ],
                      "usage": {
                        "total_tokens": 100,
                        "input_tokens": 50,
                        "output_tokens": 50,
                        "input_tokens_details": {
                          "text_tokens": 10,
                          "image_tokens": 40
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "created": 1713833628,
                  "data": [
                    {
                      "b64_json": "..."
                    }
                  ],
                  "usage": {
                    "total_tokens": 100,
                    "input_tokens": 50,
                    "output_tokens": 50,
                    "input_tokens_details": {
                      "text_tokens": 10,
                      "image_tokens": 40
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ],
        "x-model-capabilities": {
          "gpt-image-2.5-*": [
            "background",
            "moderation",
            "n",
            "output_compression",
            "output_format",
            "partial_images",
            "quality",
            "size",
            "stream",
            "user"
          ],
          "gpt-image-2*": [
            "background",
            "moderation",
            "n",
            "output_compression",
            "output_format",
            "partial_images",
            "quality",
            "size",
            "stream",
            "user"
          ],
          "gpt-image-1*": [
            "background",
            "moderation",
            "n",
            "output_compression",
            "output_format",
            "partial_images",
            "quality",
            "size",
            "stream",
            "user"
          ],
          "dall-e-3": [
            "n",
            "quality",
            "response_format",
            "size",
            "style",
            "user"
          ],
          "dall-e-2": [
            "n",
            "quality",
            "response_format",
            "size",
            "user"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/images/edits": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "图片编辑",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "网关要求显式传入 `model`、`images` 和 `prompt`。GPT Image 最多接收 16 张参考图；`dall-e-2` 只接收单张 PNG 输入；`dall-e-3` 不支持编辑。\n\nGPT Image 2/2.5 支持任意合规 `WIDTHxHEIGHT`，其他 GPT Image 使用标准三档尺寸。`input_fidelity`、`background`、`moderation`、`output_format`、`output_compression`、`stream` 和 `partial_images` 仅用于 GPT Image 系列。",
        "tags": [
          "图片生成/GPT Image"
        ],
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "model",
                  "images",
                  "prompt"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "images": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "minItems": 1,
                    "maxItems": 16,
                    "description": "必填。待编辑的源图列表。GPT Image 模型最多 16 张；每项需提供 file_id 或 image_url 之一。若直接上传文件，使用 multipart 字段 image[]（或你的网关定义的 images）。",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "file_id": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "已上传至 Files API 的源图文件 ID。"
                        },
                        "image_url": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "完整图片 URL，或 Base64 data URL。"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "prompt": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "description": "必填。期望如何编辑或扩展图像的文字描述。"
                  },
                  "background": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "transparent",
                      "opaque",
                      "auto",
                      null
                    ],
                    "description": "输出背景，仅 GPT Image 模型支持。transparent 时 output_format 必须为 png 或 webp。"
                  },
                  "input_fidelity": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "high",
                      "low",
                      null
                    ],
                    "description": "与原始输入图像保持一致的程度，仅受支持的 GPT Image 模型适用。"
                  },
                  "mask": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "description": "用于局部重绘的遮罩。file_id 与 image_url 二选一。",
                    "properties": {
                      "file_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "已上传遮罩文件的 File ID。"
                      },
                      "image_url": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "遮罩图片 URL 或 Base64 data URL。"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "model": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "gpt-image-2.5-sunburst",
                      "gpt-image-2.5-sunburst-2026-09-08",
                      "gpt-image-2.5-flare",
                      "gpt-image-2.5-flare-2026-09-08",
                      "gpt-image-2",
                      "gpt-image-2-2026-04-21",
                      "gpt-image-1.5",
                      "gpt-image-1",
                      "gpt-image-1-mini",
                      "chatgpt-image-latest",
                      "dall-e-2"
                    ],
                    "description": "必填。用于图片编辑的模型。dall-e-3 不支持图片编辑。"
                  },
                  "moderation": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "low",
                      "auto",
                      null
                    ],
                    "description": "内容审核级别，仅 GPT Image 模型支持。"
                  },
                  "n": {
                    "type": [
                      "integer",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "minimum": 1,
                    "maximum": 10,
                    "description": "要生成的编辑后图像数量。"
                  },
                  "output_compression": {
                    "type": [
                      "integer",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 100,
                    "description": "jpeg 或 webp 输出的压缩率（0–100），仅 GPT Image 模型支持。"
                  },
                  "output_format": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "png",
                      "jpeg",
                      "webp",
                      null
                    ],
                    "description": "输出图片格式，仅 GPT Image 模型支持。"
                  },
                  "partial_images": {
                    "type": [
                      "integer",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 3,
                    "description": "流式响应中生成的中间图数量。"
                  },
                  "quality": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "low",
                      "medium",
                      "high",
                      "xhigh",
                      "max",
                      "auto",
                      null
                    ],
                    "description": "输出质量。GPT Image 支持 low/medium/high/auto；GPT Image 2.5 额外支持 xhigh/max。"
                  },
                  "size": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "auto",
                      "1024x1024",
                      "1536x1024",
                      "1024x1536",
                      null
                    ],
                    "description": "图像尺寸。GPT Image 2/2.5 支持 WIDTHxHEIGHT：宽高均为 16 的倍数、比例 1:3～3:1，最高 3840x2160；其他 GPT Image 使用 auto、1024x1024、1536x1024 或 1024x1536；dall-e-2 支持 256x256、512x512、1024x1024；dall-e-3 支持 1024x1024、1792x1024、1024x1792。"
                  },
                  "stream": {
                    "type": [
                      "boolean",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "description": "是否以 SSE 事件流返回中间和最终结果。"
                  },
                  "user": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "终端用户唯一标识，用于滥用监控和检测。"
                  },
                  "response_format": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "dall-e-2 可用 url 或 b64_json。GPT Image 模型固定返回 Base64。",
                    "default": "b64_json",
                    "enum": [
                      "b64_json",
                      "url"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "examples": [
                  {
                    "images": [
                      {
                        "image_url": "https://example.com/source-image.png"
                      }
                    ],
                    "prompt": "为这张图添加水彩效果",
                    "model": "gpt-image-1.5",
                    "quality": "high",
                    "size": "1024x1024"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "example": {
                "model": "gpt-image-2",
                "prompt": "Keep the apple unchanged and replace only its background with a misty enchanted forest under soft cinematic lighting.",
                "size": "1024x1024",
                "quality": "high",
                "output_format": "png",
                "images": [
                  {
                    "image_url": "https://gd-hbimg.huaban.com/cb36fdfc6ee4707de3ec666d6bc202fb99d9bef326a10d-oQHn3b_fw658"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "created",
                    "data"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "created": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "description": "编辑结果创建时的 Unix 时间戳（秒）。"
                    },
                    "background": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "transparent",
                        "opaque"
                      ],
                      "description": "实际采用的输出背景。"
                    },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "description": "编辑后的图像列表。",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "b64_json": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "Base64 编码的图片内容。GPT Image 模型默认返回。"
                          },
                          "revised_prompt": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "DALL·E 3 的实际修订提示词；本编辑接口通常不返回该字段。"
                          },
                          "url": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "生成图片 URL。DALL·E 使用 URL 返回格式时提供，通常有效 60 分钟。"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "output_format": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "png",
                        "webp",
                        "jpeg"
                      ],
                      "description": "实际输出格式。"
                    },
                    "quality": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "low",
                        "medium",
                        "high",
                        "auto"
                      ],
                      "description": "实际使用的输出质量。"
                    },
                    "size": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "实际生成的图片尺寸。"
                    },
                    "usage": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "description": "GPT Image 模型的 token 用量。",
                      "properties": {
                        "input_tokens": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "输入文本和图像的 token 数。"
                        },
                        "input_tokens_details": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "image_tokens": {
                              "type": "integer",
                              "description": "输入图像 token 数。"
                            },
                            "text_tokens": {
                              "type": "integer",
                              "description": "输入文本 token 数。"
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "output_tokens": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "输出 token 数。"
                        },
                        "output_tokens_details": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "image_tokens": {
                              "type": "integer",
                              "description": "输出图像 token 数。"
                            },
                            "text_tokens": {
                              "type": "integer",
                              "description": "输出文本 token 数。"
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "total_tokens": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "输入和输出 token 总数。"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "examples": [
                    {
                      "created": 1713833628,
